                                                      <div class="pane__content">
              <ul class="purpose-of-stay--index">
                    <li><a href="#requirements"><div class="field-terms-title">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">Requirements</div>
      </div>
</div>
</a></li>
                          <li><a href="#process-and-costs"><div class="field-procedures-title">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">Process and costs</div>
      </div>
</div>
</a></li>
                          <li><a href="#application-forms"><div class="field-forms-title">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">Application forms</div>
      </div>
</div>
</a></li>
                              <li><a href="#see-also">See also</a></li>
                        </ul>
          </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
          
                      <div class="alert alert-muted spacing-below d-block d-sm-none">
              <div class="field-exception-text">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item"><p>Do you have a temporary asylum residence permit (Type III)? Then visit the web page <a href="/en/residence-permits/asylum/renew-asylum-residence-document" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="821bca2b-f4f5-43c1-b816-62f1ddd7885d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Renew asylum residence document">extend temporary asylum residence permit</a>.</p><p>Do you have a residence document verification against EU law for Union citizen family members? Then visit the web page <a href="/en/residence-permits/family-and-partner/verification-against-eu-law-for-union-citizen-family-members" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="434f7e2c-5602-42c8-acb1-a7075ea07bf3" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Verification against EU law for Union citizen family members">verification against EU law for Union citizen family members</a>.</p></div>
      </div>
</div>

            </div>
          
                      <div class="row no-gutters d-block d-sm-none">
              <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                


<div id="indsitewidealertmeldingen" class="block block-ind-custom">
  <div class="no-gutters row">
    <div class="col-12">
      
            
              <div data-sitewide-alert data-sitewide-alert-type="notification"></div>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>

              </div>
            </div>
          
          
          
                      <div id="requirements" class="u-show--at-print">
  

  


<section class="pane pane--default" data-pane-type="">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                          <h2 class="pane__title" tabindex="0">Requirements</h2>
                                              <div class="pane__content">
          
                                  
              
                    

  


<section class="pane--wysiwyg pane--first pane pane--default" data-pane-type="wysiwyg">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                                      <div class="pane__content">
            <div class="pane--wysiwyg">
  <div class="pane__content">
    <div class="paragraph--wysiwyg">
      <ul><li>You have a valid residence permit that you can still extend. You cannot extend the residence permits for the following residence purposes:<ul><li>Working Holiday Program/Working Holiday Scheme</li><li>Cultural exchange</li><li>Au Pair</li><li>Stay as a trainee or student on work placement</li><li>Orientation year Netherlands</li></ul></li><li>You still meet the requirements for your residence permit. For these requirements visit the web page about <a href="/en/residence-permits" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="75bda1cb-1af2-4106-a469-4382b391f50f" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Residence permits">the residence permit that you have</a>.</li><li>You have a valid passport or another travel document.</li><li>Your <a href="/en/living-in-the-netherlands-with-a-residence-permit/main-residency" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0151d8a7-bb2c-4895-9c69-09d9d6f6e968" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Main residency">main residence is in the Netherlands</a>. This means that you live in the Netherlands and spend most of your time there.</li><li>You are not a danger to public order or national security.</li><li>During the application for the residence permit you have now, you did not give any false information. And you did not withhold information. &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
              
                                              </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
          
          
                      <div id="process-and-costs" class="u-show--at-print">

          
  

  


<section class="pane pane--default" data-pane-type="">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                          <h2 class="pane__title" tabindex="0">Process and costs</h2>
                                            <h3 class="pane__subtitle u-mb--collapse" tabindex="0"><div class="field-procedures-subtitle">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">These are the steps in the application process for the residence permit:</div>
      </div>
</div>
</h3>
                                                          <div class="pane__content">
                                    
                              
      
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
                            
                            
                                                                                        
            
                                  
        
      
      

  


<section class="pane pane--default pane pane--paddingless" data-pane-type="">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                                      <div class="pane__content">
            <div class="">
    <div class="">
      <div class="paragraph--accordion">
  <div class="accordion">
    <a class="accordion__toggler initializing" role='button' tabindex='0'>
      <span class="accordion__action accordion__action--open">Show details</span>
      <span class="accordion__action accordion__action--close">Hide details</span>
    </a>

    <ul class="accordion__content">
                        <li class="accordion-item hidden procedure-content procedure-content-with-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>1. Check requirements</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>A <a href="/en/provisional-residence-permit-mvv" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="92441f75-463f-4e02-89cc-51a010a86f2a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Provisional residence permit (MVV)">valid provisional residence permit (MVV)</a> is needed for this application</p><p>Make sure you meet the <a href="#requirements">requirements</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>1. Check requirements</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>Make sure you meet the <a href="#requirements">requirements</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item hidden procedure-content procedure-content-with-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>2. Collect documents</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>The written application form lists which documents you need. Collect all documents before you apply. You can upload the documents in the online application.</p><p>Have official foreign documents&nbsp;<a href="/en/translation-and-legalisation-of-documents" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a70ee716-97be-48a1-bb7b-4dbdd9904bf2" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Translation and legalisation of documents">legalised and translated</a> into Dutch, English, French or &nbsp;German.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>2. Collect documents</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>The written application form lists which documents you need. Collect all documents before you apply. You can upload the documents in the online application.</p><p>Have official foreign documents <a href="/en/translation-and-legalisation-of-documents" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a70ee716-97be-48a1-bb7b-4dbdd9904bf2" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Translation and legalisation of documents">legalised and translated</a> into Dutch, English, French or German.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>3. Apply</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>Will your residence permit expire within 3 months? Then you can apply for extension. You can submit the application online or in writing by post. You can usually apply for extension yourself. Do you have a residence permit as a highly skilled migrant, researcher or student in higher education? Then only your recognised sponsor can submit the application via the <a href="/en/business-portal" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f8afb8a4-9dd9-43c4-8b6d-ff6a6d479005" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Business Portal">Business Portal</a>.</p><p>Is your residence permit still valid for more than 3 months? Then you cannot yet submit an application to extend your stay. The IND is then unable to make a proper assessment.</p><h4>Extend in time, prevent a residence gap&nbsp;</h4><p>You should apply for the extension while your residence permit is still valid. Has the validity of your residence permit just expired? In that case, make sure that you submit the application no later than 4 weeks after the expiry of your residence permit.&nbsp;In this way you make sure that the residence permits succeed each other and you will not have a residence gap. If you have a residence gap, it will take longer before you can apply for a permanent residence permit or become a Dutch citizen.</p><h4>Residence permit expired more than 4 weeks</h4><p>Did your residence permit expire more than 4 weeks ago? Then you should apply for extension as soon as possible. You may have a residence gap. Make sure to include a letter in which you explain why you did not apply in time.</p><h4>Residence permit expired more than 2 years</h4><p>Did your residence permit expire 2 or more years ago? Then you can no longer apply for extension. You have to apply for a new residence permit. This means that you may also have to return to your own country to apply for a <a href="/en/provisional-residence-permit-mvv" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="92441f75-463f-4e02-89cc-51a010a86f2a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Provisional residence permit (MVV)">Provisional Residence Permit (in Dutch: machtiging tot voorlopig verblijf or MVV)</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>4. Pay for application</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>You have to pay for the application. To find out how much your application costs, visit our web page <a href="/en/fees-costs-of-an-application" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="dd3911c6-a598-4819-95eb-96fbd0d2507b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Fees: costs of an application">Fees: application costs</a>.</p><p>If you submit the application online you pay immediately via iDEAL | Wero. Have you applied in writing? Then you will receive a letter explaining how you can pay.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item hidden procedure-content procedure-content-with-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>3. Wait for decision on application</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>The IND must take a decision within 90 days. This is called the decision period.</p><p>We can extend the decision period if it takes longer to decide. For example, because the application is not complete. In that case, the IND will send you a letter.</p><p><span>Do you also want to receive your post from the IND digitally? Register to receive mail in your message box (Berichtenbox) in </span><a href="https://mijn.overheid.nl/about-mijnoverheid/" title="MijnOverheid">MijnOverheid</a><span>.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="/en/my-ind" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a73c114e-e7ab-412c-82e4-f87a1aa6c2bc" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="My IND">Follow the application in My IND</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>5. Wait for decision on application</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>The IND must take a decision within 90 days. This is called the decision period.</p><p>We can extend the decision period if it takes longer to decide. For example, because the application is not complete. In that case, the IND will send you a letter.</p><p><span>Do you also want to receive your post from the IND digitally? Register to receive mail in your message box (Berichtenbox) in </span><a href="https://mijn.overheid.nl/about-mijnoverheid/" title="MijnOverheid">MijnOverheid</a><span>.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="/en/my-ind" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a73c114e-e7ab-412c-82e4-f87a1aa6c2bc" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="My IND">Follow the application in My IND</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>6. Decision on application</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>The decision will be positive or negative.</p>

<ul>
	<li>Positive decision: your residence permit will be extended.</li>
	<li>Negative decision: your residence permit will not be extended. You will receive this decision in a letter. You can&nbsp;<a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="06840fc6-cfaa-430d-8c21-19dd587a5841" href="/en/after-your-application/object-to-or-appeal-decision" title="Object to or appeal decision">object against this decision</a>.</li>
</ul>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item  procedure-content procedure-content-without-mvv"
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>7. Collect residence permit</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>When the residence permit is ready at an IND desk, you will receive a letter. You must make an appointment to collect it. <a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="711d0db1-8adb-47ef-b7ad-798587721eb2" href="/en/appointment-to-collect-document" title="Appointment to collect document">Make an appointment to collect the residence document</a>.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
          </ul>
  </div>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
            </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
          
          
                      <div id="application-forms" class="pane--wysiwyg u-show--at-print">

          
  

  


<section class="pane pane--default" data-pane-type="">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                          <h2 class="pane__title" tabindex="0">Application forms</h2>
                                            <h3 class="pane__subtitle u-mb--collapse" tabindex="0"><div class="field-forms-subtitle">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">You can submit this application online. You need to log in using DigiD. You can pay via iDEAL | Wero. Has your residence permit expired? Or were you unable to apply online? Then use the written application form which you sent to the IND by post.</div>
      </div>
</div>
</h3>
                                                          <div class="pane__content">
                                  <div class="form-without-nationality">
                          
  <div class="mb-4">
    <div class="purpose-of-stay--online-form-title">
      <h3>Online application form for extension of your residence permit</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="d-flex flex-row align-items-center justify-content-start" data-node-id="1130">
      <a href="https://eforms.ind.nl/eDienstverlening/formulier/en-GB/DefaultEnvironment/scVerlenging.aspx" class="btn btn--primary article__button mr-3">
        <span class="btn__text"> Apply online</span>
        
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--14 btn__icon">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#chevron-right"></use>
</svg>
      </a>
              
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--48 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#digid"></use>
</svg>
    <span class="visually-hidden">You need a DigiD</span>
          </div>
  </div>
                                      <h3>Written application forms</h3>
                              
                                            
  <div class="purpose-of-stay--form-row">
    Extension residence permit partner
    <div>
  
  <div class="field-media-file-1">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">
  <div class="document document__pdf">
    <a href="/en/forms/b07001e.pdf" target="_blank" class="document__url">Application residence permit: residence with married or registered partner B07001E
      <span class="document__info">(PDF,&nbsp;511.81 KB)</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
      </div>
</div>

</div>

  </div>
                              
  <div class="purpose-of-stay--form-row">
    
    <div>
  
  <div class="field-media-file-1">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item">
  <div class="document document__pdf">
    <a href="/en/forms/b07002e.pdf" target="_blank" class="document__url">Application residence permit: residence with unmarried partner B07002E
      <span class="document__info">(PDF,&nbsp;525.15 KB)</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
      </div>
</div>

</div>

  </div>
                              
  <div class="purpose-of-stay--form-row">
    Extension residence permit minor child
    <div>
  
  <div class="field-media-file-1">
    <div class="field-items">
